{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國會中期選舉最新戰況：根據美媒報道，民主黨於北卡羅萊納州「翻盤」，由Roy Cooper擊敗共和黨Michael Whaley奪得參議院議席。</p><p>此外，代表喬治亞州的民主黨籍參議員Jon Ossoff連任成功。</p><p>兩人為民主黨爭奪參院控制權拿下重要兩席。</p><p>另外，共和黨Byron Donalds成為佛羅里達州首名非裔州長。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T02:44:49.852976+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:03:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:38:18.614832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:38:18.614832+00:00","content_hash":"218905a48538f93ea5b6562ee06b226f17ef5b3c6263cb3ed5d709f25d69c2fc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}